date</title><link rel='stylesheet' href='/ota.css'></head><body data-ota-checking='␀␀␀'><div id='ota-progress' class='ota-progress' role='alert' aria-live='assertive'><div class='ota-progress-box'><div class='spinner'></div><h2 id='ota-progress-title'>Installing firmwareâ€¦</h2><p id='ota-progress-text'>Do not disconnect power or close this page.</p></div></div><div class='wrap'>␀␀␀␀<div class='card'><h1>Firmware update</h1><p class='muted'>Device: <code>␀␀␀</code><br>Current firmware: <strong>v␀␀</strong><br>Board: <strong>␀␀␀␀</strong> / ␀␀␀␀</p><p><a class='btn secondary' href='/'>Back to Web UI</a></p></div>␀␀␀<div class='msg ␀␀␀␀'>␀␀<div class='card'><h2>Automatic update</h2><p class='muted'>Use this when the device has internet access. It downloads the latest board-specific app build from the project web flasher and installs it automatically.</p>␀␀<div class='version-state current'>Checking for firmware updates in the backgroundâ€¦</div>␀<div class='version-state bad'>Update check failed: ␀␀␀␀<div class='version-state update'>New firmware available: v␀</div><form id='ota-install-form' method='post' action='/ota/install'><button type='submit'>Download and install v␀␀</button></form>␀␀␀␀<div class='version-state current'><strong>Firmware is up to date.</strong><br><span class='muted'>Latest available: v␀␀</span></div>␀␀␀<p><a class='btn secondary' href='/ota?refresh=1'>Check again</a></p><p class='muted'>Firmware file: <code>␀</code></p>␀<p class='bad'>Automatic update is unavailable for this board profile. Upload a matching app-only firmware file manually.</p>␀␀␀<div class='card'><h2>Upload compiled file</h2><p class='muted'>Use this when the device has no internet access. Select the matching app-only file such as <code>firmware-app-c3.bin</code>, <code>firmware-app-s3.bin</code>, <code>firmware-app-c5.bin</code>, or <code>firmware-app-c6.bin</code>. Do not upload the USB <code>firmware.bin</code> merged image here.</p>␀␀␀␀<form id='ota-upload-form' method='post' action='/ota/upload' enctype='multipart/form-data'>␀␀␀␀<input type='file' name='firmware' accept='.bin,application/octet-stream' required><button type='submit'>Upload and install file</button></form></div>␀␀<script src='/ota.js'></script>␀</div></body></html>␀␀␀␀refresh␀X-ESP32MIC-OTA-Reboot␀␀␀Firmware uploaded and installed. Device will reboot now.␀␀␀␀Upload failed: ␀flatline␀␀␀␀"sample_rate":␀␀"gain":␀"buffer_size":␀␀"buffer_size_recommended":512,␀␀"audio_dsp":"integer",␀␀"i2s_shift":␀␀␀␀"mic_format":␀␀␀"s3_board_supported":␀␀␀"s3_board":␀"builtin_mic":␀␀"pdm_supported":␀␀␀␀"pdm_decoder":"␀"pdm_clock_hz":␀"pdm_word_stride":␀␀"pdm_bit_order":"␀␀␀"latency_ms":␀␀␀"profile":"␀Ultra-Low Latency (Higher CPU, May have dropouts)␀␀␀Balanced (Moderate CPU, Good stability)␀Stable Streaming (Lower CPU, Excellent stability)␀␀␀High Stability (Lowest CPU, Maximum stability)␀␀"hp_enable":␀␀␀␀"hp_cutoff_hz":␀"peak_pct":␀"peak_dbfs":␀␀␀␀"clip":␀"clip_count":␀␀␀"producer_running":␀"audio_cpu_valid":␀␀"audio_cpu_pct":␀␀␀␀null␀␀␀␀"audio_cpu_peak_pct":␀␀␀"dma_overruns_available":␀␀␀"dma_overruns_total":␀␀␀"dma_overruns_1min":␀␀␀␀ ago␀␀␀␀"dma_overrun_last_age":"␀␀␀␀"mic_signal":"␀␀"mic_flatline_sec":␀"browser_listening":␀␀␀␀"i2s_error_count":␀␀"rb_capacity_bytes":␀␀␀␀"rb_chunks":␀␀␀␀"rb_drops":␀"rb_flushes":␀␀␀"rtsp_write_stalls":␀␀␀␀"rtsp_write_timeouts":␀␀"rtsp_write_failures":␀␀"rtsp_client_teardowns":␀␀␀␀"rtsp_client_disconnects":␀␀"last_stop_reason":"␀␀␀␀"last_stop_time":"␀␀"last_stop_stream":␀"last_stop_age":"␀␀␀user␀␀␀␀password␀␀␀␀clear_password␀␀off␀port␀␀␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"invalid_mqtt"}␀UI: MQTT connection saved␀␀␀sleep␀␀␀stop␀␀␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"invalid_schedule"}␀UI: streaming schedule saved␀␀␀␀UI action: factory_reset␀␀␀␀UI action: reboot␀␀␀UI action: mqtt_discovery␀␀␀UI action: network_reset (clearing Wi-Fi and rebooting)␀{"ok":false,"error":"save_failed"}␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"bad_bssid"}␀␀␀␀UI action: wifi_reconnect (BSSID pinned)␀␀␀␀UI action: wifi_reconnect␀